### List normalized client records
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/clients

### List normalized client records with filters
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/clients?latestSaveFrom=2026-01-01&latestSaveTo=2026-01-31&limit=50

### Count normalized client records
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/clients/count

### Count normalized client records for current filters
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/clients/count?latestSaveFrom=2020-01-01&latestSaveTo=2026-01-31

### Get client sync overview
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/clients/sync-overview
